+/*!
+*******************************************************************************
+
+ @Function     RGXGetFWImageSectionAllocSize
+
+ @Input        hPrivate : Implementation specific data
+ @Input        eId      : Section id
+
+ @Description  Return allocation size of a Firmware section
+
