+                                  lower 4 bits. If a bit is set, it means
+                                  that at least one slave in the network is in
+                                  the corresponding state:
+                                  - Bit 0: \a INIT
+                                  - Bit 1: \a PREOP
+                                  - Bit 2: \a SAFEOP
