+/* Name		emac_set_mac_address
+ * Arguments	pstNetdev	: pointer to net_device structure
+ *		addr : pointer to addr
+ * Return	Status: 0 - Success;  non-zero - Fail
+ * Description	It is called by upper layer to set the mac address.
